      "v": 2,
      "zh": "他问我说：「你看见了甚么？」我说：「我看见了一个纯金的灯台，顶上有灯盏，灯台上有七盏灯，每盏有七个管子。",
      "en": "He asked me, “What do you see?” I replied,[NOTE:1] “I see a menorah of pure gold with a receptacle at the top. There are seven lamps at the top, with seven[NOTE:2] pipes going to the lamps.",
